Intel iGPU at 0000:00:02.0 + NVIDIA dGPU at 2d:00.0 behind root port 00:01.0,
disk swap (not zram), coretemp, no known root-disk temperature sensor. On
Plasma 6.7.5 the ids follow ksystemstats, which enumerates PCI display
devices through libudev, in sysfs path order: the dGPU under 00:01.0 comes
before the iGPU at 00:02.0, so it is gpu0.
